# Scripted input for compose_window_menu.kt's window (KLIO_WIN_INPUT): at the
# given milliseconds after the window's first event poll, a menu item chosen
# by its titles' path, or a key as the platform would report it (AWT key
# codes; modifiers 1 shift, 2 control).
200ms menu File/Open
300ms menu File/Open Recent/plan.md
# Ctrl+Shift+N is New's shortcut.
400ms key 78 14 3
# Word Wrap twice, then the zoom levels.
500ms menu View/Word Wrap
600ms menu View/Word Wrap
700ms menu View/Zoom 150%
800ms menu View/Zoom 150%
900ms menu View/Zoom 200%
# A disabled item, its shortcut, and an item of a disabled menu: nothing.
1000ms menu File/Print
1050ms key 80 16 3
1100ms menu Help/About
# A path that is not there: nothing.
1150ms menu File/Save
# Ctrl+Shift+W is Close's shortcut.
1200ms key 87 23 3
